        "title": "refactor: burn down Matrix, Telegram, and tasks dead exports",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nThe unused-export ratchet stops new debt, but its grandfathered baseline still contains thousands of entries. This continuation of #106017 audits one bounded slice instead of attempting a repo-wide purge.\n\nThis PR audits all 202 baseline entries under `extensions/matrix` (47), `extensions/telegram` (99), and `src/tasks` (56), then removes 66 confirmed-unused exports: Matrix 15, Telegram 26, tasks 25. The baseline falls from 4,878 to 4,812 lines (-66).\n\nRelated: #105595 and #105575.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\n- Checked each candidate against repository references, tests, runtime/lazy-import seams, and dynamic/string-keyed access before changing visibility or deleting it.\n- Preserved intentional test/runtime seams, including Matrix testing hooks and detached-task runtime registration/cancellation types and helpers.\n- Left `src/plugin-sdk/` untouched; this PR changes no shipped Plugin SDK contract.\n- Kept the implementation in directory-focused commits and ran `pnpm deadcode:exports:update` after each chunk so the baseline diff stays mechanical.\n- Removed only dead export surface and related stale imports. Non-test source excluding the baseline is net -75 LOC (38 added, 113 deleted).\n\nAI-assisted implementation and review.\n\n## User Impact\n\nNo intended user-visible behavior change. Internal module surfaces are smaller, dead declarations/re-exports are gone, and the enforced unused-export baseline is 66 entries smaller.\n\nNo changelog entry: internal dead-code cleanup only.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Matrix focused tests: 118 files, 1,457 tests passed remotely.\n- Telegram focused tests: 143 files, 2,727 tests passed remotely.\n- Tasks focused tests: 22 files, 293 tests passed remotely.\n- Exact-head Blacksmith Testbox `tbx_01kxd5ne3mv1wn3k9dggz9c3zm`: `pnpm check:changed`, `pnpm build`, `pnpm plugin-sdk:surface:check`, and `pnpm deadcode:exports`.\n- Final dead-export check: baseline matched 4,804 entries.\n- Branch-wide autoreview: clean, no accepted/actionable findings, 0.97 confidence.\n- Testbox run: https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/29232122330\n",
